CLASS net/minecraft/class_1_291 net/minecraft/client/render/AllocationManager
	COMMENT Manages allocations into some piece of memory.
	COMMENT <p>
	COMMENT This class itself does not hold any actual memory to be allocated; instead,
	COMMENT it provides instances of {@link AllocationManager$Index} on allocation,
	COMMENT which can be used to index some other piece of memory held by the caller.
	COMMENT In addition, the total amount of memory that an instance of this class can
	COMMENT ‘allocate’ at once is fixed upon instantiation.
	FIELD field_1_1741 LOGGER Lorg/slf4j/Logger;
	FIELD field_1_1742 MAX_ALLOCATION_SIZE J
	FIELD field_1_1746 firstLevelAvailability I
		COMMENT Bit {@code i} is set if there is any free block for the primary index {@code i}.
	FIELD field_1_1747 freeHeadsByIndices [Lnet/minecraft/class_1_291$class_1_293;
		COMMENT One entry for every combination of first- and second-level indices. The
		COMMENT index for an entry lies at {@code 8 * firstLevelIndex + secondLevelIndex}.
	FIELD field_1_1748 secondLevelAvailabilities [I
		COMMENT One entry for every first-level index. Bit {@code i} is set if there is
		COMMENT a free block for the secondary index {@code i}.
	FIELD field_1_1749 size J
