	CLASS class_1_295 Index
		FIELD comp_1_193 I
			COMMENT {@code 0} for allocations less than 256 bytes; {@code 1} for allocations with
			COMMENT size between 256 and 511 bytes. The size threshold doubles for each
			COMMENT subsequent first-level index.
		FIELD comp_1_194 I
			COMMENT A value in [0, 8). The size range for each first-level index is divided into
			COMMENT eight equal parts, each assigned a successive second-level index.
